            <Description>This dataset is derived from the "Hari Minggoean" podcast, featuring over ten hours of recorded speech from a single, consistent speaker. The content, tailored for a young Indonesian audience, is presented in Indonesian (Bahasa Indonesia) characterized by code-switching with English and a discernible Javanese accent. The collection is comprised of 42 individual audio files (10+ hours).

